<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Arcadectl operation receipt</title>
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main-content">Skip to operation detail</a>
<nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="/">Servers</a> <a href="/operations">Operations</a></nav>
<main id="main-content">
<h1>Operation receipt</h1>
<p><a href="{{.DetailURL}}">Refresh receipt</a></p>
<dl>
<dt>Operation ID</dt><dd>{{.OperationID}}</dd>
<dt>Action</dt><dd>{{.Action}}</dd>
<dt>Reported phase</dt><dd>{{.Phase}}</dd>
<dt>Currentness</dt><dd>{{.Currentness}}</dd>
<dt>Status</dt><dd>{{.Status}}</dd>
<dt>Started</dt><dd>{{if .StartedAt}}{{.StartedAt}}{{else}}Not recorded{{end}}</dd>
<dt>Completed</dt><dd>{{if .CompletedAt}}{{.CompletedAt}}{{else}}Not recorded{{end}}</dd>
<dt>Failure</dt><dd>{{with .Failure}}{{.Code}}; {{if .Retryable}}retryable{{else}}not retryable{{end}}{{if .SuggestedAction}}; {{.SuggestedAction}}{{end}}{{else}}None{{end}}</dd>
</dl>
<p>{{.NextStep}}</p>
<p>Receipt admission and progress do not establish current server readiness. Use server status for runtime observations.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
